Subject: myrg_static.c: always include myrg_def.h

The '#ifndef stdin' guard skips myrg_def.h whenever <stdio.h> has been seen
first. On OpenVMS a forced-include header (vms_lp64.h) includes <stdio.h>
before every file, so the guard broke the file ('unknown type name LIST').
myrg_static.c is only compiled on its own, so include the header
unconditionally.

--- a/storage/myisammrg/myrg_static.c	2026-10-04 22:59:19.753196464 +0100
+++ b/storage/myisammrg/myrg_static.c	2026-10-04 22:59:19.773084451 +0100
@@ -19,9 +19,7 @@
   a shared library
 */
 
-#ifndef stdin
 #include "myrg_def.h"
-#endif
 
 LIST	*myrg_open_list=0;
 static const char *merge_insert_methods[] =
